{"type":"json_object","final":{"answer":"The reserve for product warranties increased by $6 million from 2005 to 2006, rising from $4 million to $10 million. The change is explained by 2006 activity: $4 million of pretax warranty charges, less $5 million of cash warranty outlays, plus $7 million of warranty obligations assumed in 2006 business acquisitions.","value":6,"unit":"USD_million","sources":["source:q11n2","source:q11n3","source:q12n3","source:q13n0","source:q14n0"],"result_id":"tool:1"}}